nts{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in master a0375dde960ee9dba46d461e0145123609691950\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.7-dev3\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.7-dev2\n\n### System information\n\nAndroid 15\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117682 moved plugin registration to `Godot#OnGodotSetupCompleted()`, which runs after `setup2`. Because of this, plugins are registered later during startup, and projects trying to access a plugin singleton in `_init()` can no longer find it.\n\nUsing `_ready()` is a possible workaround, but it's too late for startup-critical plugins like sign-in or app lock, which need to be available immediately when the app starts.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Download and open the demo project in editor: [godot_billing_demo_2026-05-01_12-18-56.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27270393/godot_billing_demo_2026-05-01_12-18-56.zip)\n- Install Android build template from `Project` menu.\n- Run the project on your device, it will throw \"GodotGooglePlayBilling singleton not found!\" error.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot_billing_demo_2026-05-01_12-18-56.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27270393/godot_billing_demo_2026-05-01_12-18-56.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","foll